# Game Vision

**They Will Descend** = Frostpunk-like city survival (Maya / pyramid / gods), not GMTK card game.

## Core loop

- Workers are the assignable resource
- Buildings have workplaces / slots
- Time tick drives production, consumption, pressure
- Spend resources to build / upgrade
- Pressure: survival + gods / tribute (metaphor TBD in GDD)
- Laws / crises later — after the economic loop works

## Non-goals (gameplay)

- Card dragging / Stacklands-style DnD as primary interaction
- Copying gmtk_2026 card architecture into this project
- Combat micro as a pillar

## Reference use of gmtk_2026

Allowed: setting ideas (pyramid, tribute, phases).  
Not allowed as foundation: card UI, card entities as core sim.

## Vertical slice target

Workers, few building types, few resources, time tick, assign, build, one pressure, win/lose — then expand.
